Error [E0133]: operator `/` isn't defined between `BigInt` and `BigInt`
  --> tests/ui/bigint_unsupported_op.jet:4:11
    |
  4 |     print(a / b)
    |           ^^^^^
 Why: `BigInt` and `Decimal` support `+`, `-`, `*`, and `==`/`!=` on matching types only
 Fix: use a method like `.add(other)` or make both operands the same precise type
